  "notes": "Zendesk's REST API spans Ticketing, Help Center, Chat, Talk, Sunshine and more (well over 300 documented endpoints). API tokens (basic auth, generated instantly in Admin Center) still work but Zendesk is pushing OAuth access tokens as the recommended/required method going forward; both remain documented auth paths today. Free 14-day trial accounts get an Admin Center where a token can be generated immediately, so self-serve credentials are available before any paid commitment. No official vendor MCP server found; multiple community/partner MCP servers exist (reminia, mattcoatsworth, koundinya, fruggr, Swifteq/digital4better).",
